    582  03cf							; SelectEnemies (VBLANK): decide which enemies player 1 draws this frame. Each enemy needs rows E-1 .. feet, where E is its event row (the
    583  03cf							; first row at or above top-1 that the kernel allows) and E-1 is blank. They
