   1329  29b3							; JetAct (X = a launched jet): four pixels right per update; every enemy on
   1330  29b3							; its shelf takes 10 damage as the nose passes its middle. Nose and middle
   1331  29b3							; close by at most 7 pixels an update, so each enemy is hit exactly once.
   1332  29b3				   JetAct
